LexRubric Inspect contains an adapter for the LexRubric benchmark.

Original benchmark:
LexRubric: A Rubric-Guided Diagnostic Benchmark for Open-Ended Legal Tasks
Yifan Chen, Haitao Li, Yiran Hu, Kaisong Song, Jun Lin, Yueyue Wu,
Qingyao Ai, Min Zhang, and Yiqun Liu.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.09389v1
https://github.com/foggpoy/LexRubric

The vendored evaluator, prompt, upstream documentation, and associated assets
retain their original provenance. The upstream MIT copyright and permission
notice is reproduced without changes in lexrubric_inspect/upstream/LICENSE:
Copyright (c) 2026 Yifan Chen.

Pinned source revisions and SHA-256 values are recorded in
lexrubric_inspect/upstream_manifest.json and
lexrubric_inspect/data_manifest.json. Vendored source and data are unmodified.

The adapter's LICENSE does not replace upstream notices. Dependencies are
installed separately under their respective licenses.
